osing paragraph of DECOMPOSITION-AMENDMENTS is already identified (A1) and slated for root's post-inspection correction — I neither re-raise it nor report it as done. Limits of this execution: text-only, no tool access, and applicability rests on the supplied SN rows showing no `tags` on SN-024/SN-036/SN-037; if the live rows declare tags not shown, the applicable set could widen and the brief would need re-checking. Provenance cross-check available to me: the record's subject digest 253232a5 matches `prompt-sha` in session log 690d01fb (claude-opus-5, effort high, ADVERSARIAL-REVIEW, COMPLETED, base a6b54584, matching the preflight HEAD)."},"terminal_reason":"completed","fast_mode_state":"off","uuid":"ae8280e2-4bc4-4f9d-91ad-53f025553dd6"}
